{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"Idèle"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"Idèle"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>理元 (idèle) 是"},{"Local":{"url":"Adèle","text":"加元 (adèle) 环"}},{"Plain":"的乘法单位元群:\n$$\r\n\\mathbb I = \\mathbb A^\\times.\r\n$$</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>“Idèle” 这个名字由法国数学家 Claude Chevalley 创造, 意为 “理想的元素” (ideal element), 缩写为 id.el. 而 “"},{"Local":{"url":"Adèle","text":"Adèle"}},{"Plain":"” 意为 “加性 idèle” (additive ideal element).</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"理元类群","text":"理元类群"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}